{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Knot.FigureEightQuarticCoefficient","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Knot.FigureEightQuarticCoefficient","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Knot.FigureEightComplexVolume"],"declarations":14,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.FigureEightQuarticCoefficient.imV₄₁quartic","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.FigureEightQuarticCoefficient.imV₄₁quartic","kind":"theorem","line":103,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/FigureEightQuarticCoefficient.lean#L103-L111","doc":"The imaginary part through order u⁴:\n`Im 𝔙 = (√3/4)(Re²u − Im²u) + (√3/24)·Re(u⁴)` — the diagonal structure of\n`imV₄₁` plus the quartic correction. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.FigureEightQuarticCoefficient.V₄₁quartic_even","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.FigureEightQuarticCoefficient.V₄₁quartic_even","kind":"theorem","line":98,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/FigureEightQuarticCoefficient.lean#L98-L101","doc":"NZ evenness survives the extension: `𝔙(−u) = 𝔙(u)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.FigureEightQuarticCoefficient.V₄₁quartic_eq_V₄₁_add","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.FigureEightQuarticCoefficient.V₄₁quartic_eq_V₄₁_add","kind":"theorem","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/FigureEightQuarticCoefficient.lean#L91-L96","doc":"The quartic extension agrees with the order-u² model up to the `a₄u⁴`\nterm. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.FigureEightQuarticCoefficient.V₄₁quartic_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.FigureEightQuarticCoefficient.V₄₁quartic_zero","kind":"theorem","line":88,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/FigureEightQuarticCoefficient.lean#L88-L89","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.FigureEightQuarticCoefficient.V₄₁quartic","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.FigureEightQuarticCoefficient.V₄₁quartic","kind":"def","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/FigureEightQuarticCoefficient.lean#L84-L86","doc":"The quartic-extended deformed complex volume\n`𝔙(u) = 𝔙₀ + a₂u² + a₄u⁴`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.FigureEightQuarticCoefficient.a₄_eq_neg_v₃_div_eight","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.FigureEightQuarticCoefficient.a₄_eq_neg_v₃_div_eight","kind":"theorem","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/FigureEightQuarticCoefficient.lean#L76-L82","doc":"**NZ integration, order u⁴:** `−½∫ v₃u³ = −v₃u⁴/8`, so `a₄ = −v₃/8` —\nand with the recognized `v₃ = −i√3/3` this IS `i·√3/24`, the E1/E1b\nmeasured value, now derived rather than only measured. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.FigureEightQuarticCoefficient.a₂_eq_neg_tau_div_four","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.FigureEightQuarticCoefficient.a₂_eq_neg_tau_div_four","kind":"theorem","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/FigureEightQuarticCoefficient.lean#L70-L74","doc":"**NZ integration, order u²:** `𝔙 = 𝔙₀ − ½∫v` integrates `τ·u` to\n`−τu²/4`, so `a₂ = −τ/4` — and the file's `a₂ = i√3/4` is exactly that. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.FigureEightQuarticCoefficient.v₃","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.FigureEightQuarticCoefficient.v₃","kind":"def","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/FigureEightQuarticCoefficient.lean#L66-L68","doc":"The NZ longitude's cubic coefficient: `v₃ = −i·√3/3`. CCGLS\nrecognition `(0, ∓1, 3)` — probe-certified input. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.FigureEightQuarticCoefficient.tau","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.FigureEightQuarticCoefficient.tau","kind":"def","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/FigureEightQuarticCoefficient.lean#L61-L64","doc":"The NZ longitude's linear coefficient (cusp modulus): `τ = −i·√3`.\nCCGLS A-polynomial recognition — probe-certified input, see the module\ndocstring's provenance tier. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.FigureEightQuarticCoefficient.a₄_im","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.FigureEightQuarticCoefficient.a₄_im","kind":"theorem","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/FigureEightQuarticCoefficient.lean#L59-L59","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.FigureEightQuarticCoefficient.a₄_re","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.FigureEightQuarticCoefficient.a₄_re","kind":"theorem","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/FigureEightQuarticCoefficient.lean#L58-L58","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.FigureEightQuarticCoefficient.a₄","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.FigureEightQuarticCoefficient.a₄","kind":"def","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/FigureEightQuarticCoefficient.lean#L55-L56","doc":"`a₄ = i·√3/24`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.FigureEightQuarticCoefficient.quarticModulus_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.FigureEightQuarticCoefficient.quarticModulus_pos","kind":"theorem","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/FigureEightQuarticCoefficient.lean#L51-L53","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.FigureEightQuarticCoefficient.quarticModulus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.FigureEightQuarticCoefficient.quarticModulus","kind":"def","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/FigureEightQuarticCoefficient.lean#L47-L49","doc":"The quartic modulus `√3/24` — the measured (and here NZ-derived)\n`Im`-coefficient at order `u⁴`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}